Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">الصَّلَاةُ ، الزَّكَاةُ ، الْقِيَامَةُ ، الْجَنَّةُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• الْجَوَابُ ، الصَّلَاةُ (Jawab, Namaz) → الصَّلَاةُ ، الزَّكَاةُ ، الْقِيَامَةُ ، الْجَنَّةُ (Namaz, Zakat, Qiyamat, Jannat (Gol ة = Mu'annas)).</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Unit 1 mein aasaan Qur'ani alfaaz aur buniyadi ishaare/qawa'id sikhaye gaye hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 16–17):** Jin Arbi alfaaz ke aakhir mein **Gol Taa (`ة / ـة`)** hoti hai (Jaise `الصَّلَاةُ`، `الْجَنَّةُ`، `الرَّحْمَةُ`، `الْآخِرَةُ`، `الْقِيَامَةُ`), woh **Mu'annas (Feminine)** hote hain."}},{"id":"sec_s1l2_lbl0","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Aap darj zail Quranic alfaaz ko bhi aasaani se samajh sakte hain. Di gayi jagahon mein inke maani likhein:"}},{"id":"sec_s1l2_g1","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s1l2_g1_w1","arabic":"الْجَوَاب","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجَوَاب</span>","hinglish":"Jawab","translations":{"en":"The Answer / Reply","ur":"جواب","hi":"जवाब / उत्तर"}},{"id":"s1l2_g1_w2","arabic":"الْجِهَاد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْجِهَاد</span>","hinglish":"Jihad/Koshish","translations":{"en":"Striving / Jihad","ur":"جہاد / کوشش","hi":"जिहाद / कोशिश"}},{"id":"s1l2_g1_w3","arabic":"الْحَجّ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَجّ</span>","hinglish":"Hajj","translations":{"en":"The Pilgrimage / Hajj","ur":"حج","hi":"हज"}},{"id":"s1l2_g1_w4","arabic":"الْمُهَاجِر","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُهَاجِر</span>","hinglish":"Muhajir/Hijrat karne wala","translations":{"en":"The Emigrant","ur":"مہاجر / ہجرت کرنے والا","hi":"मुहाजिर / हिजरत करने वाला"}},{"id":"s1l2_g1_w5","arabic":"الْمُجَاهِد","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْمُجَاهِد</span>","hinglish":"Mujahid","translations":{"en":"The